      "text": {
        "jp": "この結晶からも飛空艇を妨害する\r\nエネルギーが出ているようじゃな。",
        "official_en": "’Twould seem this crystal emanates an energy that repels our airship.",
        "real_en": "This crystal seems to be giving off energy that interferes with our airship, too."
