      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "この結晶を破壊すれば、\r\n飛空艇で、ここまで来られるようになるじゃろう。",
        "official_en": "Sundering this crystal shall allow us to return here by airship.",
        "real_en": "If we destroy this crystal, we'll be able to reach this place by airship."
