      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ふう。\r\nこれで、ここにも飛空艇が来られるの。",
        "official_en": "Phew. Now we may come here by airship if the need arises.",
        "real_en": "Phew. Now the airship can reach this spot, too."
      },
      "review": {
