        "official_en_sha256": "a9f902c74c043531df0565fffee3744da6de125608e3bd0fc194e5a3c979d1b1"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "やつとの決戦は近そうじゃ。\r\n補給が必要なら、一度飛空艇に戻るのも手じゃな。",
        "official_en": "The final battle awaits. If we have need of supplies, ’twould be prudent to return to the airship before proceeding.",
        "real_en": "Looks like our final battle with him is near. If we need supplies, we could return to the airship first."
      },
      "review": {
