        "official_en_sha256": "43c0c19277a1ae692cd539949c92a497bf493d21c8355e02d9cde2907cfeb3d9"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "よしよし。\r\nこれでこの高さまで飛空艇でこられるのう。",
        "official_en": "Splendid. We can reach these heights again via airship now.",
        "real_en": "Good, good. Now the airship can reach this height."
      },
