        "official_en_sha256": "c783b8f31a99553bd931c7828ffd1e77da6a4ef517588570cf1ffd47436b73a1"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "長丁場じゃから、無理は禁物じゃ。\r\n補給が必要になったらここから戻るとするかの。",
        "official_en": "Our journey is a long one—we cannot afford to take unnecessary risks. If a resupply is needed, ’twould be wise to return to the airship from here.",
        "real_en": "We've got a long way to go, so let's not overdo it. If we need supplies, we can head back from here."
      },
